The published `@tynd/mcp` package contains a small launcher for the native Rust
`tynd-mcp` executable, 14 framework documents, and 7 generated plugin schemas.
The executable is supplied by `@tynd/tooling` through the matching platform
package.

No third-party JavaScript MCP runtime is bundled. Third-party notices for the
native executable are collected in the `@tynd/tooling` NOTICE.
